      "fieldData": {
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Daily Report Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a daily report form?\", \"a\": \"A daily report form is a short form someone fills in when a shift or workday ends to record what happened: the work done, the figures that matter, and any problems. Because it uses the same fields every day, the reports can be compared and searched later.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a daily report form?\", \"a\": \"Describe the report to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a> in a few sentences: who files it, what it records, when it is due, and who should hear about a problem. Emergent builds the form with a database for the reports and the alerts you asked for. File two or three sample reports before you share the link.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should an infant daily report form include?\", \"a\": \"An infant daily report form should include what parents ask about at pickup: each feeding with its time and amount, nap start and end times, and diaper changes. Add a mood line and a notes field for firsts, such as a new food, plus a line that tells the family when diapers or wipes are running low.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do daycares share infant daily report forms with parents?\", \"a\": \"Hand each family a paper copy at pickup, or email it at the same hour every day. Pick one of the two and keep to it, and parents learn when to look. A bump or a bite belongs on a separate <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/incident-report-form'>incident report form</a>, not in the day's log.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a daily work report form include?\", \"a\": \"A daily work report form should include the tasks finished and the hours spent on each, plus anything blocked or carried over to tomorrow. Keep it short enough to finish in five minutes, with one line per task. Emergent puts no cap on responses: a crew of 40 filing every day never runs into a monthly limit.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should infant toddler daily report forms track?\", \"a\": \"Infant toddler daily report forms should track different things for each age. Track bottles and diaper changes on the infant report, and switch to meals eaten and potty training on the toddler report. An app built with Emergent can carry both on one form, showing the infant or toddler questions based on the room you pick.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a construction daily report form include?\", \"a\": \"A construction daily report form should record the day on site: who was on site from each trade and what got built in each area, plus any delay with its cause. Have the superintendent file it before leaving the site. If someone is hurt, record it the same day on a separate <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/accident-report-form'>accident report form</a>, not in the daily log.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a construction daily safety report form?\", \"a\": \"A construction daily safety report form is a site's daily safety record, kept apart from the progress log. Use it for the toolbox talk and who attended, plus hazards found and fixed. Give near misses their own question so they can be counted. In an app built with Emergent, a near miss on the form can trigger an alert to the safety manager when the report is filed.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is a daily cash report form?\", \"a\": \"A daily cash report form records each register's cash at close: the opening float, the cash sales the register shows, the cash counted, and the difference between them. Set a tolerance that fits your sales volume, and have a second person sign off on any count outside it.\"}, {\"q\": \"When is a daily report form template enough?\", \"a\": \"A daily report form template is enough when all you need is the record itself, filed the same way each day. Build an app instead when reports should trigger something, such as a reminder to whoever has not filed or an alert on a bad number. The same choice comes up with a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/complaint-form'>complaint form</a> that needs to reach a manager the day it arrives.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
